%% Microservices Communication
sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant TS as support-ticket-service:8080
    participant DB as PostgreSQL:5432
    participant DS as technician-dispatch-service:8081

    C->>TS: POST /tickets (JWT)
    activate TS
    TS->>DB: TX-1: insert ticket ABIERTO + history CREATED
    DB-->>TS: ticket persisted
    TS->>DS: POST /technician-dispatch (ticketId, categoria, prioridad)
    activate DS
    DS-->>TS: {tecnicoId, disponibilidad, tiempoEstimadoHoras}
    deactivate DS
    TS->>DB: TX-2: evaluate eligibility + assign + history ASSIGNED
    DB-->>TS: assignment saved
    TS-->>C: 200 {ticket, status, assignedTechnician}
    deactivate TS
